FreeBSD msun / musl (acos, atan, atan2)
---------------------------------------

`src/fastsasa_exact_math.h` contains double-precision acos, atan and atan2
routines derived from the FreeBSD msun sources (e_acos.c, s_atan.c,
e_atan2.c) as distributed by musl. They are compiled for both the CPU
reference and the CUDA FP64 kernels so both produce bit-identical results.

